; atc_return.ngc - Return the current tool to its carousel pocket
;
; Called by flexihal_atc.c tool_change() when the requested tool is NOT
; in the carousel but the outgoing tool IS.  Parameter set by plugin:
;
;   #4902 = outgoing carousel pocket number
;
; atc_pause.ngc runs immediately after to handle the manual swap.
; No $TCMEASURE here - that is handled by atc_pause.ngc.
;
; See atc_change.ngc for geometry parameter definitions (#4910-#4917).

; ── Calculate return pocket XY ───────────────────────────────────────────────
#100 = [#4910 + [#4902 - 1] * #4912]   ; pocket X
#101 = #4911                             ; pocket Y

; ── Retract to safe Z ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
G53 G0 Z0

; ── Move to pocket and release tool ──────────────────────────────────────────
G53 G0 X#100 Y#101
G53 G0 Z#4913
G53 G1 Z#4914 F#4915
$DRBO
G4 P0.5
G53 G0 Z0

M2
